          "snippet": {
            "line": 104,
            "text": "theorem regularInverseJet_bound_on_order {ε F : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε) (hF : 0 ≤ F)\n    (f : ℕ → ℕ → ℝ) (k : ℕ) (hz : JetVanishesBelow f k)\n    (hf : ∀ n m, |f n m| ≤ F * weight ε n m) (n m : ℕ) :\n    |regularInverseJet 2 f n m| ≤\n      (80 / radialDivisor 2 k) * F * weight ε n m"
          }
